        "@value": "{\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"scope_text\":\"Applies to a report provided under paragraph (2), except for offenses requiring a showing of intent to defraud or mislead.\",\"summary\":\"A report provided under paragraph (2) may not be used as the basis for criminal prosecution of the reporting person under section 1264 of this title, except for offenses which require a showing of intent to defraud or mislead.\"}",
